timestamp=2026-11-14T09:33:34.499Z level=INFO run=881cf0d6 message=evaluated permission=bash pattern="python3 -c '\nimport numpy as np\nfrom scipy.spatial import cKDTree\n\npts_a = np.load(\"/app/pts_a.npy\")\nleg1 = pts_a[(pts_a[:, 0] > 1.6) & (pts_a[:, 0] < 2.0)]\ncy, cz = 0.914270, -0.068295\ndy = leg1[:, 1] - cy\ndz = leg1[:, 2] - cz\ntheta = np.arctan2(dz, dy)\nr = np.hypot(dy, dz)\nfor b in range(24):\n    t0 = -np.pi + b * (2*np.pi/24)\n    t1 = t0 + (2*np.pi/24)\n    m = (theta >= t0) & (theta < t1)\n    print(f\"angle [{np.rad2deg(t0):6.1f}, {np.rad2deg(t1):6.1f}]: r_min={r[m].min():.5f}, r_med={np.median(r[m]):.5f}, r_max={r[m].max():.5f}\")\n'" action.permission=* action.action=allow action.pattern=*
